# OS junk only.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored: .collab/ and *.events.jsonl. Consultation briefs,
# replies, raw event streams and the sessions.json ledger are meant to be
# committed next to the code they were about - that is the point of this tool.

.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~

# Bridge runtime files inside a task directory. .consult.lock is a permanent,
# informational ownership file (never delete it); .consult.pending.json exists
# only during or after an interrupted consultation. Neither belongs in history.
.consult.lock
.consult.pending.json
